 itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:28.843" end="01:29.066">We </span><span begin="01:29.066" end="01:29.524">keep </span><span begin="01:29.524" end="01:30.357">quiet </span><span begin="01:30.357" end="01:30.602">'cause </span><span begin="01:30.602" end="01:30.813">we're </span><span begin="01:30.813" end="01:31.355">dead </span><span begin="01:31.355" end="01:31.476">if </span><span begin="01:31.476" end="01:31.664">they </span><span begin="01:31.664" end="01:32.111">knew</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们压抑着声息 被他们发现我们就完蛋了</span></p><p begin="01:32.111" end="01:39.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:32.111" end="01:32.351">So </span><span begin="01:32.351" end="01:32.650">close </span><span begin="01:32.650" end="01:32.903">your </span><span begin="01:32.903" end="01:34.069">eyes </span><span begin="01:35.147" end="01:35.636">escape </span><span begin="01:35.636" end="01:35.886">this </span><span begin="01:35.886" end="01:36.333">town </span><span begin="01:36.333" end="01:36.613">for </span><span begin="01:36.613" end="01:36.925">a </span><span begin="01:36.925" end="01:37.430">little </span><span begin="01:37.430" end="01:39.374">while</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那么闭上你的双眼 逃避这个喧嚣的尘世 即使只有如此短暂的一刻</span></p><p begin="01:40.681" end="01:44.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:40.681" end="01:40.946">'Cause </span><span begin="01:40.946" end="01:41.179">you </span><span begin="01:41.179" end="01:41.454">were </span><span begin="01:41.454" end="01:42.184">Romeo </span><span begin="01:42.184" end="01:42.466">I </span><span begin="01:42.466" end="01:42.687">was </span><span begin="01:42.687" end="01:42.965">a </span><span begin="01:42.965" end="01:43.710">scarlet </span><span begin="01:43.710" end="01:44.475">letter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为你是罗密欧 我们便像红字里的主人公 我们的爱情不被人接受</span></p><p begin="01:44.475" end="01:45.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="0